getting the following errors at the fixating stage of the CD writing
process:-

  Fixating...
  cdrecord: Input/output error. philips fixation: scsi sendcmd: retryable
error
  CDB:  E9 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 01 00
  status: 0x2 (CHECK CONDITION)
  Sense Bytes: 70 00 06 00 00 00 00 0A 00 00 00 00 29 00 00 00
