Fru 0x0
  Sense flags: Blk 0 (not valid)
  cmd finished after 65.643s timeout 480s
  Fixating time:   65.692s

and then this when it tries to eject the CD:-

  cdrecord: Input/output error. prevent/allow medium removal: scsi sendcmd:
retryable error
  CDB:  1E 00 00 00 00 00
  status: 0x2 (CHECK CONDITION)
  Sense Bytes: 70 00 02 00 00 00 00 0A 00 00 00 00 04 00 00 00
