  Sense Code: 0x04 Qual 0x00 (logical unit not ready, cause not reportable)
Fru 0x0
  Sense flags: Blk 0 (not valid) 
  cmd finished after 0.001s timeout 40s

This doesn't seem to prevent use of the freshly written CD, but does seem to
prevent me from making multisession disks.  It doesn't seem to happen when
the CDR is hooked up to an intel box running RHL 6.2...  Any ideas?

