Supposedly, it works.  It requires that you have the glide libraries
installed, though (you'll need the Glide3-64bit branch from CVS).

I built the XF 4.0.1 debs for Debian, but haven't enabled the DRI yet on
that distribution since we don't have a package that supplies the glide
