>  I put my question another way; is there MILO for XP1000
>  (or any other 21264 machine) or is there not? Or am I
>  just plain stupid?

Not to my knowledge.  Basically, the rule of thumb is: if it boots only
from SRM, it doesn't have a MILO.  If the system has ARC/ARCS/AlphaBIOS,
then it should have a MILO available.  I believe the last system that
could use MILO was the Ruffian.

C




