> Even RH7.0 is not capable of cleanly running a 2.4.testxx
> kernel. Modules are fun, they like to play hide n' seek.

I run 2.4 test kernels on basically 6.2 so I do not know
why you would have problems with RH7.  Just grab the latest
modutils from updates (for 6.x and 7 distros).  You want to
that anyway for other reasons even if you do not plan to touch
any of 2.4 kernels.

  Michal




